ly6\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply7\">Question 7:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Calcule &#58; \\(4.5 \\times 4 \\times (-5)\\) <br> Réponse &#58;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply8\">Question 8:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\((-8)^2= {}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply9\">Question 9:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Simplifie au maximum la fraction &#58; \\(\\frac{45}{27}\\)<br>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"10\"></span> <div class=\"wims_instruction\">Seule l'écriture fractionnaire sera acceptée.</div></div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply10\">Question 10:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Quelle est la médiane de ces 5 notes &#63; <br> <table class=\"wims_noborder\"><tr><th>9.5</th><th>8</th><th>13</th><th>11</th><th>6.5</th></tr></table> <br> Réponse &#58;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply10\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply11\">Question 11:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(1.25 \\times 20 ={}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply11\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply12\">Question 12:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(610 \\) \\(cm^3 ={} \\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply12\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \\(L\\)</div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply13\">Question 13:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\">\t  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"240\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 200\"><polygon points=\"40.00,120.00 160.00,160.00 193.16,60.52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"134.44\" y1=\"151.48\" x2=\"141.84\" y2=\"129.28\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"141.84\" y1=\"129.28\" x2=\"167.40\" y2=\"137.80\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><text x=\"32.00\" y=\"120.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">A</text><text x=\"200.00\" y=\"52.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">C</text><text x=\"160.00\" y=\"168.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">B</text><text x=\"96.00\" y=\"68.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">10 cm</text><text x=\"80.00\" y=\"148.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">6 cm</text></svg></span><br> La valeur exacte de BC est &#58;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply13\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \\(\\text{cm}\\)</div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply14\">Question 14:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Calcule \\(- 5 x + 2 y\\) pour <br> \\(x = 6\\) et \\(y = 3\\) <br> Réponse &#58;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply14\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply15\">Question 15:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  8 cahiers identiques coûtent \\(10\\) &euro;.<br><STRONG>Combien coûtent 12 cahiers &#63;</strong><br>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply15\" data-size=\"10\"></span> &euro;.</div>\t ",
